                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="steps" value="0 · once per session: no session → redirect, you log in AT Keycloak, a signed token (sub, preferred_username, roles) comes back; session alive → silent pass&#xa;1 · browser sends the request — only the session cookie travels, no passwords&#xa;2 · HAProxy terminates TLS, the operator’s Ingress routes to the gateway&#xa;3 · proxy checks the session, forwards over loopback stamped X-Forwarded-Preferred-Username: dev-analyst&#xa;4 · shim reads that person’s key: open(&quot;/etc/warehouse-users/dev-analyst&quot;) — and strips everything typed or forged (user=, password=, X-ClickHouse-*)&#xa;5 · shim forwards with X-ClickHouse-User + key — ClickHouse sees a normal login, grants apply, query_log names you" style="text;html=1;fontSize=12;align=left;spacingLeft=6;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="-110" y="745" width="640" height="150" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="safety" value="the shim believes the name-stamp ONLY because it binds 127.0.0.1 —&#xa;nothing but the proxy in its own pod can reach it" style="rounded=1;html=1;fillColor=#f5f5f5;strokeColor=#666666;fontSize=11;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="1000" y="790" width="360" height="60" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
            </root>
